  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5605.05 Bulk Distribution",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5605.05 Bulk Distribution. For purposes of RSA 260:14, V(a)(8), disclosures for bulk distribution for surveys, marketing or solicitations shall be made via electronic media or in printed list or label format and only if a minimum number of 250 names is requested, unless otherwise approved by the commissioner.\n\nSource. #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
